  "_comment": "The org project board (design 6.6). apply-board.py creates it and its fields; verify-settings.py checks them. Type (issue type) and Owner (Assignees) are GitHub's built-in fields. Views cannot be scripted: see board-views.md. Single-select option names match the issue form answers exactly.",
